**Not fully implemented / simplified from the spec:**
- The exact arcade tractor-beam cone shape and its "pull the ship up into the formation slot" visual are approximated — the captured fighter is held just above the player's position and the Boss dives away; freeing it docks the dual fighter but the freed ship doesn't first re-fly into the formation.
- Boss "turns blue/purple after its first hit" is shown as a palette swap and HP counter, but the arcade's specific two-frame boss look is stylised.
- Escort dive geometry (perfect 3-ship V) is approximated; escorts follow the Boss loosely.
- Enemy bullet speed / dive frequency scaling is tuned, not arcade-accurate.
- The title-screen demo is a lightweight attract loop (auto-firing fighter + formation), not a full scripted Galaga demo.
- Sound effects are synthesized approximations, not sampled arcade audio.
